; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§2.2–2.3, pp. 16–24; local typed letter/word transition interfaces"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"2"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> (alphabet)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{NFA}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{NFA}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> (nondeterministic finite automaton, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5abb4703af79a510\" href=\"?note=5abb4703af79a510\" title=\"73-df-nfa-structure\">73-df-nfa-structure</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nfa\\text{-}run}\\vdash\n\\widehat{\\delta}_M:Q\\times\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathcal P(Q)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nfa\\text{-}run}\\vdash\n\\widehat{\\delta}_M:Q\\times\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathcal P(Q)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nfa\\text{-}run}\\vdash\n\\widehat{\\delta}_M(q,\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq\\{q\\},\\qquad\n\\widehat{\\delta}_M(q,wa)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{p\\in\\widehat{\\delta}_M(q,w)}\\delta(p,a)\n\\quad(q\\in Q,\\;w\\in\\Sigma^*,\\;a\\in\\Sigma)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nfa\\text{-}run}\\vdash\n\\widehat{\\delta}_M(q,\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq\\{q\\},\\qquad\n\\widehat{\\delta}_M(q,wa)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{p\\in\\widehat{\\delta}_M(q,w)}\\delta(p,a)\n\\quad(q\\in Q,\\;w\\in\\Sigma^*,\\;a\\in\\Sigma)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Structural recursion on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|w|\">\\(|w|\\)</span> is well founded and preserves the codomain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(Q)\">\\(\\mathcal P(Q)\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-nfa-structure","status":"resolved","id":"5abb4703af79a510","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-nfa-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-nfa-structure","status":"resolved","id":"5abb4703af79a510","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{NFA}_{\\Sigma}$ (nondeterministic finite automaton, see [[73-df-nfa-structure]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{NFA}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nfa\\text{-}run}\\vdash\n\\widehat{\\delta}_M:Q\\times\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathcal P(Q)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nfa\\text{-}run}\\vdash\n\\widehat{\\delta}_M(q,\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq\\{q\\},\\qquad\n\\widehat{\\delta}_M(q,wa)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{p\\in\\widehat{\\delta}_M(q,w)}\\delta(p,a)\n\\quad(q\\in Q,\\;w\\in\\Sigma^*,\\;a\\in\\Sigma)","display":true},{"tex":"|w|","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(Q)","display":false}],"bytes":1514,"backlinks":[{"id":"52ddba8829989be5","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\widehat{\\delta}_M$ 见 [[73-df-nfa-extended-transiti